# alias-form.trk -- one row per bar (120).
track pad   cva   # 1
track bass  cva   # 2
track drums cva   # 3
track lead  cva   # 4
track stab  cva   # 5
track crush cva   # 6  lead bitcrush (p, normalized: 1 = 8 bits, less = coarser)
track verb  cva   # 7
track main  cva   # 8

pattern form 120
#    pad    bass   drums  lead   stab   crush  verb   main
00  | .3>  | .6   | 0    | 0    | 0    | .8   | .5   | 1    # intro: pad and reese
15  | .7   | .    | .    | .    | .    | .    | .    | .
16  | .5   | .9   | 1    | 0    | .8   | .8   | .3   | .    # A: the break
48  | .8   | .5   | .7   | .9   | 0    | .9>  | .55  | .    # break: half time, the lead
63  | .    | .    | .    | .    | .    | .6   | .    | .
64  | .5   | .95  | 1    | .85  | .7   | .6>  | .35  | .    # B
95  | .    | .    | .    | .    | .    | .35  | .    | .
96  | .6>  | .8>  | .8>  | 0    | 0    | .    | .5   | .    # outro
111 | .5   | .3   | .3   | .    | .    | .    | .    | .
112 | .5>  | 0    | 0    | .    | .    | .    | .7   | .    # end: the pad, alone
119 | 0    | .    | .    | .    | .    | .    | .    | .

